      {{! ================= CONCEPT ================= }}
      <section class="ac-sec ac-concept" id="concept">
        <div class="ac-concept__grid">
          <div class="ac-concept__aside ac-reveal">
            <span class="ac-eyebrow">Concept</span>
            <h2>Aqua-Crete<br />Concept</h2>
            <div class="ac-keychips">
              <span class="ac-keychip">100% inorganic, non-combustible</span>
              <span class="ac-keychip">GORE-TEX® function</span>
              <span class="ac-keychip">Strong adhesion</span>
              <span class="ac-keychip">Odor-free application</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="ac-concept__body ac-reveal" data-d="1">
            <p>Aqua-Crete is a finish material made from a powder binder
              composed entirely of inorganic, non-combustible ingredients and a
              water-based liquid. It is applied by trowel or spray directly onto
              building substrates — concrete (cement mortar), masonry, tile,
              EIFS finishes, and more — whether the surface is dry or saturated
              with water (100% moisture content).</p>
            <p>Because NEP-certified Aqua-Crete is made from 100%
              non-combustible materials, it does not burn or release toxic gases
              in a fire. It offers excellent breathability and waterproofing
              (GORE-TEX® function), produces no odor during application, and
              bonds powerfully to the substrate — an inorganic, non-combustible
              finish with built-in waterproofing performance.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

